### Components Organization

- Unless otherwise specified, all NextJS code uses "NextJS app root path" as defined above as the root path and all mentioned paths are assumed to be relative to this folder.
- All new Sitecore components are created in [NextJS app root path]/src/components folder, use subfolder for organization if provided by user if not try to fit the component in the most appropriate folder.  If not specified (e.g. "helper component"), assume "Component" refers to a "Sitecore Component"
- Storybook component are created in [NextJS app root path]/src/stories/components.Further organize storybook component in same was as original component folder structure in [NextJS app root path]/components folder. 
- Helper components should live under [NextJS app root path]/src/helpers folder in the appropriate folder.  
    * React Contexts go in the Context folder
    * SitecoreWrappers are reserved for helper components that wrap OOTB Sitecore JSS components.
- React hooks go under [NextJS app root path]/src/lib/hooks.  Where appropriate, create or use a folder for organizing.
- General utility functions go under [NextJS app root path]/src/lib/utils.  Create files and folders as needed.

